{"id": 6416, "group": "tredence-oa", "sent_at": "2026-10-14T03:13:20.958086+00:00", "text": "online assessment had about 20 MCQs on aptitude,\n2 DSA problems medium to hard level, I was asked LRU cache, Queries based problem in OA\nthen communication round online\nthen 3 interviews, 2tech + 1 hr\ntech round 1 : about internship, SQL, Projects\ntech round 2 : resume based, Projects\nhr : conflict resolution", "author_tag": "VNIT", "reply_to": {"id": 6326, "text": "can you share problems", "author_tag": "NITR"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
