{"id": 15285, "group": "tredence-oa", "sent_at": "2026-10-28T18:36:54.845941+00:00", "text": "This was the pattern for Tredence \n1. DSA\n2. SQL\n3. MCQ\n\nAlong with this there were 34 MCQs and 2 questions were python ML related\n\nIn those 2 questions some data cleaning code snippet was given with some blanks we need to write appropriate function name for the blank\nAnd in the other question they asked to write a function for getting shape of dataset, then data type of all columns, count and percent of null values, mean median mode of numeric columns", "author_tag": "IITH", "reply_to": {"id": 14667, "text": "anyone Tredence OA pattern and format please...", "author_tag": "IITG"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
